Hi all,

Below is a summary of the firm's domain portfolio. The firm holds 34 domain registrations and 5 related services, all set to auto-renew on the Visa ending 9554 (exp. 7/2029). These registrations exist primarily to support the firm's website and email. braunhagey.com is our live website and email domain. Nearly every other registration is a defensive one: a misspelling of "braunhagey" or the firm name under a different extension (.net, .org, .legal, and so on).

WHY THE VARIATIONS MATTER
Every BraunHagey variation we don't own is one an outsider can register. A bad actor holding a lookalike domain, such as brauhnagey.com or braunhagey.co, could send email that looks like it comes from the firm, put up a lookalike website, or catch messages that clients, courts, or opposing counsel send to a mistyped address. For a law firm, a spoofed address can lead to wire-fraud attempts on clients, leaks of confidential communications, and damage to the firm's reputation. Owning the variations ourselves shuts down those risks for a small yearly cost. We should keep buying full domains for the common variations of the firm name, including misspellings, transposed letters, phonetic spellings, and the major extensions, and renew the ones we already hold.

PRIMARY DOMAINS AND SERVICES
- braunhagey.com - Website Security Essential - renews 4/2/2027
- braunhagey.com - No Protection - renews 8/12/2027
- braunhagey.net - No Protection - renews 11/19/2035
- Microsoft 365 Email Essentials with Security (bhb@whistleblowertoolkit.net) - renews 10/2/2027
- Website Security Basic, "New Account" (no domain assigned) - renews 3/7/2029

DEFENSIVE MISSPELLING REGISTRATIONS (all No Protection)
- 3/1/2027: braunhgaey.com, brauhnagey.com, barunhagey.com, brawnhagey.com, braunhagye.com, braunhaegy.com, branhagey.com, braumhagey.com, braunhayey.com, breunhagey.com
- 7/1/2027: braunhageys.co
- 7/2/2027: brownhagey.com, braunhage.com, braunhagen.com, braunhager.com, braunhaty.com, braunhagy.com

BRAUNHAGEY UNDER OTHER EXTENSIONS (all No Protection)
- 7/1/2031: .info, .live, .life, .org, .biz, .club, .me, .co, .xyz, .online
- 11/19/2035: .legal, .lawyer
- Not listed: .attorney

ANIMALWELLFAREAPPROVED
- animalwellfareapproved.com - Ultimate Domain Protection & Security; Website Security Basic - renews 9/26/2027
- animalwellfareapproved.org - Ultimate Domain Protection & Security; Website Security Basic - renews 9/26/2027

RECOMMENDATIONS
- Keep and expand the variations. Renew every defensive registration we hold, and buy additional common misspellings and extensions of the firm name as they come up.
- Protect the primary domain. braunhagey.com runs the firm's website and email but has no domain protection. It is the one registration where a hijacking or a lapse would cause the most harm.
- Update the payment card. The Visa ending 9554 expires 7/2029, but 13 domains renew in 2031 or 2035. Those renewals will fail, and the domains could lapse, unless the card on file is updated.
- Confirm the "animalwellfareapproved" spelling. The usual spelling is "welfare" with one "l." Confirm the double-"l" registration is intentional, and consider whether the correctly spelled domain should also be held.
- Assign or cancel the unassigned security plan. The Website Security Basic plan labeled "New Account" isn't tied to a domain.

Best,

--bhbboundary2026
